---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: tpl
---
<div class="wrap sec sec--tight tpl-page">
  <div class="tpl-actions">
    <button type="button" class="jc-btn jc-btn--primary" data-print hidden><svg class="jc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 9V4h10v5M7 17H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v6a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-2M7 14h10v6H7z"/></svg>Print</button>
    <a class="jc-btn" href="/templates/{{ slug }}.pdf"><svg class="jc-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"/></svg>Download PDF</a>
  </div>
  <div class="sheet">
{{ content | safe }}
  </div>
  <div class="tpl-after">
    <h2 class="h2 h2--sm">How to use it</h2>
    <ul class="tpl-tips">
      {%- for tip in tips %}
      <li>{{ tip }}</li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="tpl-note">Jobchit, when it opens, does this on your phone: you write the change, the customer signs with a finger, and you both get a dated PDF. <a href="/#waitlist">Join the waitlist</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
